{"seq":4,"slug":"python-advanced","title":"Python 进阶","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.33,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"python-进阶-简介\">Python 进阶 简介</h1><p>Python 以其简洁优雅的语法和丰富的生态系统成为全球最受欢迎的编程语言之一。然而，从「能用 Python 写代码」到「写出高质量的 Python 代码」之间存在巨大的鸿沟。Python 进阶旨在帮助开发者跨越这一鸿沟，深入理解语言的内部机制，掌握编写高效、可维护、Pythonic 代码的核心技巧。</p>\n<p>本手册面向已经掌握 Python 基础语法、希望进一步提升编程能力的中高级开发者。无论你是数据工程师、后端开发者还是自动化脚本编写者，这里都能帮助你将 Python 技能提升到新的层次。</p>\n<p>全书将深入探讨以下核心主题：Python 数据模型与魔术方法、装饰器与闭包的高级用法、迭代器与生成器的设计模式、元类与描述符协议、类型提示与静态分析、并发编程（多线程、多进程、asyncio）、内存管理与性能优化、包管理与项目结构化，以及测试策略与调试技巧。通过这些进阶内容的学习，你将成为真正精通 Python 的高级开发者。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-system","title":"类型系统与标注","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"type-annotations","title":"类型标注与 typing 模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/type-annotations"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protocols","title":"Protocol 与结构化子类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/protocols"},{"seq":3,"slug":"generics","title":"泛型与 TypeVar","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/generics"},{"seq":4,"slug":"runtime-validation","title":"运行时类型检查与 Pydantic","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/runtime-validation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"async-programming","title":"异步编程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asyncio-event-loop","title":"asyncio 事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/asyncio-event-loop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coroutines-and-tasks","title":"协程与任务调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/coroutines-and-tasks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-io","title":"异步 IO 与网络","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/async-io"},{"seq":4,"slug":"concurrency-patterns","title":"并发模式与最佳实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/concurrency-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaprogramming","title":"元编程","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"advanced-decorators","title":"装饰器进阶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/advanced-decorators"},{"seq":2,"slug":"descriptors","title":"描述符与属性协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/descriptors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"metaclasses","title":"元类与类工厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/metaclasses"},{"seq":4,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成与 AST","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/metaprogramming/code-generation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"data-science","title":"数据科学生态","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"numpy","title":"NumPy 与向量化计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/numpy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pandas","title":"Pandas 数据处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/pandas"},{"seq":3,"slug":"visualization","title":"数据可视化 Matplotlib/Plotly","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/visualization"},{"seq":4,"slug":"jupyter","title":"Jupyter 与交互式分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/data-science/jupyter"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"project-structure","title":"项目结构与包管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/project-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pytest","title":"测试框架 pytest","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/engineering/pytest"},{"seq":3,"slug":"profilin